            "description": "<b>WHEN:</b> Your Command phase.<br><br><b>TARGET:</b> One Wolf Guard Headtaker or Wolf Guard Terminator Pack Leader model from your army.<br><br><b>EFFECT:</b> Until the start of your next Command phase, your model has the <span class=\"kwb\">CHARACTER</span> keyword.<br><br><b>Designer’s Note:</b> While in effect, your model’s unit is therefore a <span class=\"kwb\">CHARACTER</span> unit, meaning it can interact with the Heroes All rule, in addition to other rules that interact with <span class=\"kwb\">CHARACTER</span> units.",
